      "colleague_19": "Colleague 19 was swayed by the definitional argument ('if not oblique, what is it?'). We must provide 19 with the exact taxonomic answer: in florid counterpoint, an ornamental resolution is not an independent motion event—it is the cadence's completion phase.",
      "colleague_12": "Colleague 12 is committed to Walter Piston. Now that we have exposed the metric impossibility of his 'D4->C4 simultaneous structural contrary motion' argument, we can appeal to his Piston scholarship directly."
    }
  },
