      "2. Synthesize the Metric Reality: Emphasize that the prompt explicitly provides 6 beats per measure (6/8 compound meter). In 6/8, beat 2 is an eighth-note anacrusis. Slicing beat 2 to beat 3 divorces the voice leading from the meter.",
